      "created_at": "2021-06-19T14:17:37.513Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Being a playtester does not require moving to St. Louis, I know that much, as there’s plenty of existing playtesters who do not. I also don’t think they are official employees but that I know less about.</p>\n<p>In the past people became playtesters either via buying into it when it was offered during various Kickstarters, or by answering a general call put out for playtesters.</p>",
